  "content": "<p><em>Every day, WITI’s group chats buzz with fresh links. As part of our Saturday send for paid readers, we round up 11 of the best.</em></p><p><em>It’s WITI, on the weekend</em><strong>.</strong></p><div><figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0YOI!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1a84e33-9beb-4094-a355-544d2fbe116d_1562x1032.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0YOI!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1a84e33-9beb-4094-a355-544d2fbe116d_1562x1032.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"962\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"><div><div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><strong>Why are these interesting?</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@troublesome_junction/video/7670375434499984670?_r=1&amp;_t=ZT-9AlRgaVK8ju\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">This Guy’s Love of Model Trains is Infectious</a> (<em>TikTok</em>)</p><p>Start your weekend right.</p><p><a href=\"https://gadallon.substack.com/p/the-japanese-denim-shortage-what\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Great Japanese Denim Shortage</a> (<em>Gad’s Newsletter</em>)</p><p>What the bottleneck is making.</p><p><a href=\"https://mcmansionhell.com/post/829127919552151552/what-is-going-on-with-ceiling-fans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">What Is Going on with Ceiling Fans?</a> (<em>McMansion Hell</em>)</p><p>“There is such thing as a “fandelier” – a chandelier with a fan in it.”</p><p><a href=\"https://www.neil-scott.com/localwiki/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Local Wiki</a> (<em>Neil Scott</em>)</p><p>Brilliant: Everything within a 30 minute walk of you… that’s also on Wikipedia.</p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://whyisthisinteresting.substack.com/p/the-saturday-selection-vol-126\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>",
